<title>UK: Scotia full-year losses widen.</title>
<headline>Scotia full-year losses widen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		25.0 loss	    vs 16.7 loss</p>
<p> Pretax		     19.13 loss	   vs 11.76 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   16.46		  vs 15.64</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it had received confirmation that the UK Medicine Control Agency (MCA) would not recommend approval of its diabetic drug Tarabetic. It also announced a reorganisation of the company's business into four main areas.</p>
<p>Full company name - Scotia Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
